<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Woolworth raised to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Woolworth raised to buy.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Deutsche Morgan Grenfell said it upgraded Woolworth Corp to buy from hold.</p>
<p>-- Raised 1997 earnings estimate to $1.65 per share from $1.60, kept 1998 estimate at $1.95 and set 1999 estimate at $2.35.</p>
<p>-- Cited potential closing of some domestic stores as enhancing appeal. Said asset reallocations, elimination of loss divisions and further cost cuts &quot;could probably add another $1.00 of earnings power to next year's earnings estimate.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Target price is &quot;low-30's&quot;.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose one to 25-7/8.</p>
